# Natural convection in a differentially heated cubic cavity.
# Hot west wall, cold east wall, adiabatic on the other faces.
#
# Run via:
#   run_simulation("examples/natural_convection_3d.krk")

Simulation natural_convection_3d D3Q19
Domain L = 1.0 x 1.0 x 1.0  N = 16 x 16 x 16
Physics nu = 0.05 Pr = 0.71 Ra = 1e3
Boundary west wall T = 1.0
Boundary east wall T = 0.0
Boundary south wall
Boundary north wall
Boundary bottom wall
Boundary top wall

Run 200 steps
